<title>FINLAND: TULIKIVI APPOINTS NEW MANAGING DIRECTOR.</title>
<headline>TULIKIVI APPOINTS NEW MANAGING DIRECTOR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish stone oven maker Tulikivi Oy said on Monday it had appointed Reijo Svanborg managing director from July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Tulikivi's board has named Reijo Svanborg group managing director,&quot; Tulikivi said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@Reuters.fi</p>
